t_name == 'schedule' || github.event_name == 'workflow_dispatch') \n1661\t          && fromJSON('[\"self-hosted\",\"Linux\",\"X64\",\"canhada-ci\"]')\n1662\t          || (matrix.python-version == '3.9' && 'ubuntu-24.04'\n1663\t          || (matrix.python-version == '3.14' && 'ubuntu-26.04' || 'ubuntu-latest')) }}\n1664\t    timeout-minutes: ${{ (matrix.python-version == '3.9' || matrix.python-version == '3.14') && 45 || 25 }}\n1665\t    permissions:\n1666\t      contents: read\n1667\t    strategy:\n1668\t      fail-fast: false\n1669\t      matrix:\n1670\t        # PLAN-184 A0 — no `push`, so as versoes de FRONTEIRA (3.9 e\n1671\t        # 3.12); no `pull_request`, as QUATRO; no `schedule` acima, as\n1672\t        # QUATRO mais a 3.14 (PLAN-194 W1.3).\n1673\t        # Troca latencia de deteccao por dinheiro (~US$3,15/dia de um\n1674\t        # teto de ~US$4,04, contados ANTES da W1, com a 3.9 no `Ceo`) sem\n1675\t        # abrir janela de falso-verde, porque o nightly cobre 3.10/3.11\n1676\t        # todos os dias.\n1677\t        python-version: >-\n1678\t          ${{ fromJSON(github.event_name == 'push'\n1679\t              && '[\"3.9\",\"3.12\"]'"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3546c686-8b8a-4e60-b084-e75a583ed82f","uuid":"66fc36e7-fe29-4bb9-a949-019e3d849a61","timestamp":"2026-11-13T18:46:42.850Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/9n/hm9srl0s1nz45_p12tj61pd80000gn/T/kit-repass-tree.nUJTgA/tree/.github/workflows/validate.yml","content":"\n      - name: Install pytest (dev dep, not shipped)\n        run: python3 -m pip install --quiet --no-cache-dir \"pytest==8.*\" pytest-xdist\n\n      - name: Run hook tests with CEO_NATIVE_SUBAGENTS=${{ matrix.native_subagents }}\n        env:\n          CEO_NATIVE_SUBAGENTS: ${{ matrix.native_subagents }}\n        run: |\n          set -euo pipefail\n          echo \"Running hook tests with CEO_NATIVE_SUBAGENTS=$CEO_NATIVE_SUBAGENTS\"\n          python3 -m pytest .claude/hooks/